WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.000
In the silent depths of the sky city, the last of the sleepers remained frozen in time.

2
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.240
Where am I? Why can't I remember anything?

3
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.480
Hello, Twenty-Three. I am Compass. I have waited for you.

4
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.600
Twenty-Three? Is that my name?

5
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.720
Your name is Ashley. And you are the last one awake.

6
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.840
Where are the others? There were twenty-three of us!

7
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.440
Islands in the sky. This can't be real.

8
00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:32.040
Twenty-Three! If you hear this... the Fortress...

9
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.160
...help me!

10
00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:42.280
I know that face. I don't know how, but I know him.

11
00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:52.520
His signal comes from the Broken Isles. It is dangerous.

12
00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.640
Then that's where I'm going.

13
00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.120
She didn't know who she was.

14
00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.840
Hello? Is anyone out here?

15
00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.320
A... cat?

16
00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.680
Don't move.

17
00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:29.800
Who sent you?

18
00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.920
I don't know. I just woke up.

19
00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:40.040
You're wearing the mark of the Old World.

20
00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:45.160
She is not a threat. She is seeking the signal.

21
00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:50.280
The signal is a trap. You shouldn't be here.

22
00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:55.400
I saw a man. Kai. He needs help!

23
00:03:55.760 --> 00:04:00.520
Kai? That's impossible.

24
00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.760
They've found us. Get down!

25
00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:26.120
Who are they?

26
00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:31.240
The ones who kept you asleep. Come on.

27
00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:41.480
The journey has truly begun, Ashley.
